  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: 'He walks away, shoulders stiff. You expected to feel victorious. It is working, so why does it feel so hollow?'
